Subject: [PATCH 45/53] =?UTF-8?q?Nova=20(iPhone)=20IAP:=20400/422=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20yakuniy=20rad=20etish,=20tranzaksiya=20yopiladi;=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?429?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- verify 422 (sandbox_not_allowed, family_shared_not_supported,
  wrong_bundle, unknown_product, wrong_type, bad_transaction) va 400
  (invalid_signature, bad_request) — YAKUNIY: completePurchase chaqiriladi,
  StoreKit abadiy qayta bermaydi; aniq xabar (test xaridi / Family
  Sharing / umumiy "yordamga murojaat qiling").
- 429 — ochiq qoladi, "keyinroq urinib ko'ring". 403/409/503/tarmoq —
  avvalgidek ochiq; 409 matni: shu Apple ID obunasi boshqa hisobga ulangan.
- Sinovlar: har bir tarmoq (yakuniy — bir marta yopiladi, vaqtincha — yo'q).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X3fizJ3F3nvfvUZqdZamcq
